From 7731eb11053c855fd9d888a0006a2d94c39bb0ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 04:09:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tools/dvbridge, utils: the copyright line in the files that
 are Hades' own

Kodi's LICENSES/README.md asks for a copyright line with the SPDX line of
every file. Fourteen files that Hades wrote had only the SPDX line: in
tools/dvbridge, dvbridge_hdr10plus, dvbridge_measure, dvbridge_measured,
dvbridge_probe, dvbridge_dvplus and dvbridge_dvplus_gl (.c and .h); and
xbmc/utils/ProgressiveVideo.cpp and .h. Each now starts with the header
that the other files of Hades carry (Copyright (C) 2026 Hades, the file
is not in Kodi as Team Kodi publishes it, its SPDX line as it was). The
files that came from CroqueMr's fork keep their headers as the fork
wrote them. Only the comment changes: the code of each file without its
comments is the same as before.
